00:19:08,641 --> 00:19:13,511
どんな理由であってさ あなたは私たちのオリーなんだからね…
Whatever the reason may be, you are still our Ollie, you know...

130
00:19:14,111 --> 00:19:24,111
Unless you turn out to be a- たとえば先輩が… あ、先輩の言いたいことは… どんな先輩でも私たちは友達ということが変わらない…
Unless you turn out to be a- What she means to say is... No matter what kind of senpai you are, you'll still be our friend...

131
00:19:24,111 --> 00:19:27,861
Aww thanks guys ララ…みんなありがとう！
Aww thanks guys. Aww... thanks everyone!

132
00:19:27,861 --> 00:19:38,271
Well I'll- そしたらもう少し周りの人に聞いてみる！ がんばってね！ またね！ 手がかり見つかるといいね！ またね！もっか会うやろ、ローの…
Well I'll ask around a bit more! Good luck! See you! Hope you find some clues! See you! Hope we see you in the lore...

133
00:20:10,673 --> 00:20:15,273
[Title: サンドリヨン 
 Lyrics: orange Music: Dios／シグナルP]
[Title: Cendrillon 
 Lyrics: orange Music: Dios／Signal-P]

134
00:20:29,293 --> 00:20:34,333
街まで踊る 夢だけ見せて 時計の針が刻むわ
Dancing all the way to town, showing only dreams as the clock's hands tick away

135
00:20:34,773 --> 00:20:39,213
曖昧な指 誘う階段 惨めな飛び跳ねて行く
Ambiguous fingers invite me up the stairs, as I pathetically hop and skip along

136
00:20:43,293 --> 00:20:48,173
舞踏会の中で 震えていた
Trembling in the middle of the ball

137
00:20:48,473 --> 00:20:54,193
惨めな古び めぐり巡れ夜の舞踏
Spinning round and round through the pitiful, aged night's ball

138
00:20:56,293 --> 00:21:00,753
見知らぬ顔が ガラス越し囁くあの声が
Unfamiliar faces whisper through the glass, that voice

139
00:21:00,993 --> 00:21:06,993
握り締めた 恋 今付いたって 全てを奪えと
Clasping that love tightly, just as it started, telling me to take everything

140
00:21:09,993 --> 00:21:15,613
身なし子を連れ 後ろ髪 引かれ行く
Taking the orphan along, with our hair pulled back as we go

141
00:21:16,493 --> 00:21:21,973
いつわりの衣装に身を包み 離れつつ結ぶ
Clothed in false attire, pulling apart yet binding together

142
00:21:35,493 --> 00:21:40,973
舞踏会の中で 赤く 溶けて混じる ガラスの靴
In the middle of the ball, melting and mixing in red, the glass slipper

143
00:21:48,893 --> 00:21:54,753
今更帰る 震えているの あなたが目をやる時計
Returning now, trembling at the clock you are looking at

144
00:21:55,293 --> 00:22:02,213
靴脱ぎ踊る 白を脱ぎ捨て 喉まで伸びる 指の先で
Taking off shoes and dancing, stripping off white, at the very tips of fingers reaching up to the throat

145
00:22:03,293 --> 00:22:08,613
くすくす 口づけて 走る衝動 骨の髄 抜けて行く
Giggling, kissing, the rushing impulse piercing straight to the marrow of my bones

146
00:22:16,193 --> 00:22:22,213
鐘は鳴らさないで 新たに刻む 鼓動 又ダメと叫んだ
Do not ring the bell, marking a new heartbeat, shouting that it's no good again

147
00:22:22,493 --> 00:22:29,693
右手が引き裂いたよ さよなら けせない照明を 香水に身を染め
My right hand tore it away, farewell, perfuming the unerasable lights

148
00:22:35,993 --> 00:22:42,613
瞳に僕の顔が 仮面 ごとうつむく
My face reflected in your eyes, looking down behind a mask

149
00:22:49,093 --> 00:22:55,513
今も耳鳴りとする 太い息が 月日 刺さるの とおい
Even now, a ringing in my ears, heavy breathing stabbing through the days, so far away

150
00:23:00,093 --> 00:23:08,213
夢 ステンドグラス越しの 光 隙間が 君に被せたベール
Dreams, the light through the stained glass, the gaps forming a veil draped over you

151
00:23:14,693 --> 00:23:20,993
それすり減らして ピアノは投げる 娘合う 瞳と瞳が
Worn down, the piano throws it, eyes meeting eyes, shedding tears

152
00:23:28,093 --> 00:23:34,993
孤独な魂が 炎を上げ 光り合う その涙 スクえないなら
If those lonely souls raising flames and glowing for each other cannot save those tears

153
00:23:38,093 --> 00:23:47,513
まだ一人 踊り場 今はあなたに 酔いしれて 揺れる鼓動 一つ一つを 刻みつけてたい
Still dancing alone on the landing, intoxicated by you right now, wanting to carve every single pulsing beat into my memory

154
00:23:55,093 --> 00:24:00,693
とどまれ 熱く濡れ 打ち付ける 高まりに
Stay, hot and wet, crashing against this mounting surge

155
00:24:00,893 --> 00:24:08,093
これ以上は 動けないよ まさに 競り上がっている
I can't move any more than this, right as it's rising to a climax

156
00:24:27,930 --> 00:24:31,370
Zzzzz... Zzzzz... Hmm..? Huh..?

157
00:24:32,050 --> 00:24:33,810
えっ... な... み...
W-Wh... A...

158
00:24:33,950 --> 00:24:36,270
みやび先輩?! あ、目が覚めたんだね。おはよう。
Miyabi-senpai?! Ah, you're awake. Good morning.

159
00:24:38,190 --> 00:24:40,670
み、みやび先輩?! ここで何してるの?
M-Miyabi-senpai?! What are you doing here?!

160
00:24:41,670 --> 00:24:44,830
今日は僕もスタジオでのダンスリハーサルがあるんだ。
I have dance rehearsal in the studio today too.

161
00:24:45,050 --> 00:24:49,330
歩いてたら道端で寝ているオリーを見つけて...
And then I found you sleeping here on the side of the road...

162
00:24:48,180 --> 00:24:53,280
[Text: (AAAH MALU BANGET!!) (BERARTI TADI MIYABI-SENPAI LIAT AKU TIDUR DONG?!)]
[Text: (GAAH I CAN'T BELIEVE IT!!) (I SHOWED MY SLEEPING FACE TO MIYABI-SENPAI?!)]

163
00:24:54,090 --> 00:24:56,530
オリーはなんでここで寝ていたの?
And what about you? Why are you sleeping here?

164
00:24:57,250 --> 00:24:58,810
おっ... うっ...
Oh... Uh...

165
00:25:00,192 --> 00:25:01,542
Ceritanya agak panjang sih...
It's kind of a long story...

166
00:25:02,092 --> 00:25:05,872
Jadi akhir-akhir ini Ollie kepikiran sama alasan kenapa Ollie menjadi zombie...
I've been thinking about my origins... You know, the reason to why I became a zombie...

167
00:25:06,282 --> 00:25:07,012
Ah

168
00:25:07,012 --> 00:25:09,712
Emang kamu bangun dari kubur karena rumah kamu jadi toko ramen?
Isn't it because you sensed that your house turned into a ramen shop? Or so I heard

169
00:25:10,322 --> 00:25:10,932
Bukan senpai
That was actually a coincidence

170
00:25:11,232 --> 00:25:14,752
Itu kebetulan aja pas Ollie bangun rumah Ollie jadi toko ramen...
I happen to wake up and it already was a ramen shop...

171
00:25:15,212 --> 00:25:15,922
Terus..
And you know?

172
00:25:16,692 --> 00:25:19,532
Semakin Ollie pikirin eksistensi Ollie..
The more I think about my existence...

173
00:25:20,112 --> 00:25:22,522
Semakin Ollie mikirin takdir Ollie...
The more I think about fate...

174
00:25:23,052 --> 00:25:25,692
Kenapa takdir membangunkan Ollie?
Why did it make me live, I wonder?

175
00:25:26,142 --> 00:25:29,712
Apa cerita Ollie belum tamat habis meninggal?
Why is my grave not the end of my chapter? Can't help it...

176
00:25:30,112 --> 00:25:31,352
Ternyata Ollie lagi mikirin ini ya...
I see, so you've been having those thoughts...

177
00:25:31,522 --> 00:25:33,822
Pasti sulit ya...
It must be hard for you to think about

178
00:25:34,072 --> 00:25:38,842
Tapi tahu gak sih? Kadang hal-hal seperti ini malah lebih baik dibiarkan apa adanya
But you know, sometimes there are things that are best left as is...

179
00:25:39,032 --> 00:25:43,282
Jadi nggak usah dipikirin nanti jawabannya juga dateng sendiri kok...
I don't think you need to ponder too much about it, surely the answer will come to you on its own...

180
00:25:44,092 --> 00:25:46,502
Iyo juga ya... Benar juga...
You know what, you're right senpai...

181
00:25:47,092 --> 00:25:48,432
Ngapain ya buru-buru...
I shouldn't rush too much...

182
00:25:49,172 --> 00:25:51,582
Kalau memang takdir nanti juga tahu...
Surely I'll find out sooner or later!

183
00:25:52,322 --> 00:25:53,792
Baguslah kalau mengerti...
I'm glad I got to help you...

184
00:25:54,222 --> 00:25:56,942
Yak kalo gitu senpai duluan ya, senpai harus latihan...
Anyways, I have dance practice so I better take my leave now

185
00:25:57,162 --> 00:26:00,082
Baik! Terima kasih banyak senpai!
I will! Thank you so much senpai!

186
00:26:00,282 --> 00:26:01,542
Jaga diri ya, Ollie!
Take care, Ollie!

187
00:26:02,202 --> 00:26:04,692
Senpai benar... Senpai keliru-eh maksudnya senpai benar...
He's right... Senpai is right...

188
00:26:05,212 --> 00:26:10,012
Aku gak usah banyak pikiran... Nanti waktunya juga dateng kok...
I shouldn't think about it too much... I should just take my time...

189
00:26:15,619 --> 00:26:20,239
Padahal akhirnya... aku bukannya dapat jawaban, malah ngabuburit kemana-mana.
In the end, I just wasted my day looking for an answer that I don't even know exists...

190
00:26:21,179 --> 00:26:25,359
Tapi senpai sampai aku tinggal lagi. Jadi gak enak aku...
I feel bad for bailing on dance practice with lofi-senpai, I gotta apologize later...

191
00:26:27,229 --> 00:26:30,439
Jawabannya bakal datang sendiri... Hah...
"The answer will come to me sooner or later," huh...

192
00:26:31,159 --> 00:26:35,399
Iyaa... moga-moga jawabannya gak ngaret datangnya. Keburu meninggal lagi aku.
I hope I won't have to wait too long that I get revived a second time...

193
00:26:36,129 --> 00:26:39,199
Andai ya dapat petunjuk sedikit aja.
If only there were some sort of clue...

194
00:26:41,229 --> 00:26:44,479
Itu... bunga kah? Kok tumbuhnya di pinggir jalan sih? Aneh.
Is that a flower? What's it doing growing at a busy street like this? How weird.

195
00:26:48,969 --> 00:26:51,199
Ini tuh bukan tempat kamu, bunga kecil.
This isn't your place little daisy.

196
00:26:51,779 --> 00:26:53,739
Kamu seharusnya tumbuh di tempat lain.
You belong somewhere else where...

197
00:26:54,159 --> 00:26:57,269
Kalau tumbuhnya di sini, yang ada kamu malah layu...
If you were to stay, then you'll only wilt...

198
00:27:04,699 --> 00:27:06,529
Barusan... apa yang...
W-What... Just... Happened...?

199
00:27:07,129 --> 00:27:08,969
Nya... Nya... Mekar?
It... Bloomed..

200
00:27:16,989 --> 00:27:19,059
Barusan... Apaan?
What in the world...

201
00:27:19,439 --> 00:27:21,999
Yang barusan tuh... aku?
Did... I do that...?

202
00:27:22,349 --> 00:27:25,199
Jadi... ini kah?
... Is this it...?

203
00:27:32,579 --> 00:27:37,589
Trust in me, I'll be back in the days

204
00:27:37,589 --> 00:27:42,369
Trust in me, I'll be back in the days

205
00:27:42,699 --> 00:27:47,979
どんな痛みはどんな気持ちで手に入れたんだ?
What kind of pain, with what kind of feeling did I obtain it?

206
00:27:48,109 --> 00:27:53,019
青くて長いテープを切って残りは全部捨てたんだ
I cut the long blue tape and threw away everything else

207
00:27:53,319 --> 00:27:58,429
だって理解できないから 身勝手許されないから
Because I can't understand, because selfishness isn't forgiven

208
00:27:58,429 --> 00:28:03,139
全部燃やし尽くしていつか笑える日までは back in the days
Burn it all down until the day we can laugh again, back in the days

209
00:28:03,319 --> 00:28:08,059
ざまあ見ろ 産まれ落ちた生命 惑星呪いくせしてせいぜい
Serves you right, a newborn life, cursing the planet, at best

210
00:28:08,159 --> 00:28:13,329
焼野原に見えてんだ? かける言葉も見つかりやしないや
Does it look like a burnt field? I can't even find words to say

211
00:28:13,329 --> 00:28:18,369
星が砂に変わってしまったんじゃない
It's not that the stars turned into sand

212
00:28:18,369 --> 00:28:22,879
僕の心が砂でできてたんだ
It's that my heart was made of sand

213
00:28:23,049 --> 00:28:30,439
誰もが置き去りにした世界で始まりの歌を歌い続ける
In a world where everyone was left behind, I'll keep singing the song of beginnings

214
00:28:30,749 --> 00:28:36,659
もうわかってんだ 希求しゃがれた声を上げれば また君に会える気がした
I already knew, if I raised my hoarse voice, I felt like I could meet you again

215
00:28:36,969 --> 00:28:44,299
ねえ 聴こえているんでしょう?
Hey, you can hear it, right?

216
00:28:44,299 --> 00:28:52,599
(Trust in me, I'll be back in the days)

217
00:28:52,599 --> 00:28:59,929
僕らノンフィクションにしたくて 魔法使いを嫌っていた
Wanting to make us non-fiction, I hated wizards

218
00:29:00,049 --> 00:29:08,299
都合のいい世界だけを望んで生きている 矛盾まみれの人生論と歩いてきた四半世紀
Living wishing only for a convenient world, I've walked a quarter-century with a life theory full of contradictions

219
00:29:08,409 --> 00:29:13,719
掛け違えたボタンも笑える日が来るなら
If a day will come when I can laugh even at misbuttoned buttons

220
00:29:13,919 --> 00:29:18,759
誰もが置き去りにした世界で
In a world where everyone was left behind

221
00:29:18,759 --> 00:29:22,599
始まりの歌を歌い続ける
I'll keep singing the song of beginnings

222
00:29:22,599 --> 00:29:30,599
もうわかってんだ 希求しゃがれた声を上げれば また君に会える気がした
I already knew, if I raised my hoarse voice, I felt like I could meet you again

223
00:29:30,599 --> 00:29:38,349
ねえ 聴こえているんでしょう?
Hey, you can hear it, right?

224
00:29:38,349 --> 00:29:52,599
(Trust in me, I'll be back in the days)

225
00:30:00,432 --> 00:30:05,052
今夜、君と出会ったんだ
Tonight, I met you...

226
00:30:05,232 --> 00:30:09,692
誰もが置き去りにした世界で
In a world everyone left behind,

227
00:30:09,692 --> 00:30:14,712
始まりの歌を歌い続ける
I'll keep on singing the song of beginnings.

228
00:30:15,152 --> 00:30:20,192
もう気付いてたんだ　ひどくしゃがれた声は
I already noticed, my terribly hoarse voice

229
00:30:20,432 --> 00:30:24,192
きっと　知りえない君に届いている
is surely reaching you, whom I cannot know.

230
00:30:24,532 --> 00:30:27,252
ねえ　聴いているでしょう？
Hey, you're listening, right?

231
00:30:32,652 --> 00:30:43,192
暗闇の中のジブンに巡り巡る今日を走っていくんだ
Running through today that circles back to myself in the darkness...

232
00:32:11,892 --> 00:32:14,472
壊れとハリズエ
Broken props and posturing,

233
00:32:24,272 --> 00:32:29,912
想うようにいけないなら　私を捨てて君は生きて
If things don't go as you wish, throw me away and live on.

234
00:32:29,912 --> 00:32:35,152
狂ってんだ　君の残響は　僕じゃなくたって聴こえるのに
You're mad, your lingering echo is heard even if it's not by me.

235
00:32:35,152 --> 00:32:41,032
自傷案を募るたびに　幸せ捨てて毒を吐いて
Every time I gather self-harm plans, I throw away happiness and spew poison.

236
00:32:41,352 --> 00:32:46,512
理想ジャンキー二人だけが正解なんて気持ちいいじゃんか
Ideal junkies, isn't it great that only the two of us are right?

237
00:32:46,512 --> 00:32:51,632
会いたいと貸した病が愛なくて惚れて殺すがしたくて殺ってやったぜ
The illness of wanting to see you had no love, so I wanted to fall in love and kill, and I went and killed you.

238
00:32:51,632 --> 00:32:56,772
ドキドキドキドキなって僕が君を殺す前に死んでくれ
Heart beating fast, before I kill you, please die.

239
00:32:57,112 --> 00:33:02,152
ズルしていいよ　ずるくていいよ　壊していいよ　壊していいよ
It's okay to cheat, it's okay to be sly, it's okay to break things, it's okay to destroy!

240
00:33:02,152 --> 00:33:07,572
怯懦の愛はここに埋めよう　忘れるんだこんなのももうやめよう
Let's bury cowardly love right here, let's forget this and stop doing this already.

241
00:33:07,572 --> 00:33:13,592
嫌ったほうが　嫌っていても思ったほうが　思っていいじゃんか
It's better to hate, even if you hate, it's better to think, isn't it fine to think so?

242
00:33:13,592 --> 00:33:19,272
もう笑えない僕のアンデッドアリス
My Undead Alice who can no longer smile.

243
00:33:22,352 --> 00:33:26,892
予想通り僕の夢が輝くほど疑惑がかかっていて
As expected, the more my dreams shine, the more doubt clings to them.

244
00:33:27,132 --> 00:33:32,072
犠牲を我慢と呼んで　汚れた手で撫で回した
Calling sacrifice patience, I stroked you with tainted hands.

245
00:33:32,592 --> 00:33:37,512
悪いないようにしないように　それがつまり悪い形
So as not to do evil, that in short is an evil shape.

246
00:33:37,972 --> 00:33:42,692
保存状態　相合傘　レトロで何度も聴いた旗揚げマッチか
Preserved state, shared umbrella, retro, how many times have I heard this flag-raising match?

247
00:33:42,972 --> 00:33:48,472
正しくないことなら毒が　願いを叶えちゃってやっつけらいや
If it's not right, poison fulfills the wish, go ahead and defeat it!

248
00:33:48,472 --> 00:33:52,672
脳みそ塞ぎ乗って僕が僕を殺す前に死んでやる
Plugging my brain, before I kill myself, I'll make you die.

249
00:33:52,932 --> 00:33:58,052
ズルしていいよ　ずるくていいよ　壊していいよ　壊していいよ
It's okay to cheat, it's okay to be sly, it's okay to break things, it's okay to destroy!

250
00:33:58,052 --> 00:34:03,132
怯懦の愛はここに埋めよう　忘れるんだこんなのももうやめよう
Let's bury cowardly love right here, let's forget this and stop doing this already.

251
00:34:03,132 --> 00:34:09,232
嫌ったほうが　嫌っていても思ったほうが　思っていいじゃんか
It's better to hate, even if you hate, it's better to think, isn't it fine to think so?

252
00:34:09,232 --> 00:34:14,732
もう笑えない僕のアンデッドアリス
My Undead Alice who can no longer smile.

253
00:34:27,292 --> 00:34:32,332
ずっとこのまま　二人で夢を見れるって
That we could keep dreaming together just like this forever,

254
00:34:32,772 --> 00:34:37,912
勝手ばかりで　君はどんな顔で笑っていたっけ
being so selfish, what kind of face were you smiling with?

255
00:34:35,612 --> 00:34:49,312
辛いじゃん　胸を裂いて愛を潰してくれよ
It hurts, isn't it? Tear open my chest and crush my love.

256
00:34:38,332 --> 00:34:43,312
バイバイしたから元通りなんて幻想だ
Since we said goodbye, the idea that things are back to normal is an illusion.

257
00:34:51,792 --> 00:35:00,112
ズルしていいよ　ずるくていいよ　壊していいよ　壊していいよ
It's okay to cheat, it's okay to be sly, it's okay to break things, it's okay to destroy!

258
00:35:00,256 --> 00:35:02,226
そんなこと もうやめよう
Just stop doing things like that.

259
00:35:02,396 --> 00:35:04,756
切った方がいいでしょ
It's better to cut it off, right?

260
00:35:05,266 --> 00:35:08,336
でも想った方が重くていいじゃんか
But it's fine if those feelings are heavy, right?

261
00:35:08,896 --> 00:35:11,366
もう笑えない僕の
My self that can no longer smile...

262
00:35:12,316 --> 00:35:15,826
アンネットとハリステなんだっていいよ
Annette and Harist, whatever is fine.

263
00:35:15,826 --> 00:35:20,016
死にたいくらいじゃ消え失せもしないや 消えそうくらいじゃ消え失せもしないや
Not even wanting to die will make it disappear. Not even almost fading away will make it vanish.

264
00:35:20,256 --> 00:35:23,136
ごめんねなんて言えるはずない
There's no way I can say 'I'm sorry'.

265
